      "description": "Word-file transcription distributed by Documenta Catholica Omnia (also circulated as the Riksarkivet CRB texts), book \"IX\". Cleaned by research/sourcing/_scripts/bridget_build.py: drop-cap braces and stray quotes removed, hyperlink artefacts removed, the edition's inline verse numbers dropped (paragraphs break at verse boundaries), chapter rubrics kept in italics under each heading.",
